WEBVTT

00:00:14.090 --> 00:00:15.090
You're done now.

00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:17.140
Those who control auto-tracking Stands…

00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:19.100
It's F.F.!

00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:21.100
Why are they at this Disciplinary Wing?

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:28.230
He has a disc!

00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:31.320
Pale Snake is nearby!

00:00:32.030 --> 00:00:32.900
Where is he?

00:00:35.860 --> 00:00:37.120
No way…

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:38.410
The one who threw it was…

00:00:39.410 --> 00:00:40.620
It can't be him!

00:00:41.370 --> 00:00:43.580
So the one who controls Pale Snake is…

00:00:44.910 --> 00:00:46.580
You are…

00:00:47.170 --> 00:00:48.500
Father Pucchi.

00:02:20.590 --> 00:02:23.010
F.F. feared one thing above all else.

00:02:23.100 --> 00:02:26.770
It wasn't the destruction of their body,

00:02:26.850 --> 00:02:30.230
but the elimination
of their own intellect.

00:02:31.980 --> 00:02:38.150
I remember everything
since the day I met Jolyne.

00:02:39.110 --> 00:02:41.490
The weird graffiti on prison phones,

00:02:42.070 --> 00:02:44.950
the lint-covered blankets on the bed,
and the smell of garbage.

00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:47.040
The guard's shouts,

00:02:47.620 --> 00:02:51.250
the sounds of doors opening and closing,
and the toilet flushing, even.

00:02:52.960 --> 00:02:55.960
Fooling around with Jolyne
and the others and laughing together.

00:02:56.050 --> 00:02:57.170
I remember them all.

00:02:58.210 --> 00:03:04.390
But before I met Jolyne at the farm,
though I lived there for years,

00:03:04.470 --> 00:03:08.140
all I can recall from that time are
memories that are like a machine's.

00:03:08.810 --> 00:03:09.930
That's all.

00:03:10.440 --> 00:03:13.100
I followed orders
without ever questioning why

00:03:13.190 --> 00:03:16.150
and spent the days
guarding Pale Snake's discs.

00:03:17.610 --> 00:03:19.110
But now, I know

00:03:19.190 --> 00:03:22.860
that to live means to make memories.

00:03:23.990 --> 00:03:26.120
I fear losing them the most.

00:03:28.120 --> 00:03:30.500
Jolyne is on a mission to save her father

00:03:30.580 --> 00:03:34.580
and is willing to risk her life
for the ones she cares about like Ermes.

00:03:34.670 --> 00:03:37.960
That's probably because
she has good memories of them.

00:03:38.840 --> 00:03:41.930
That's what powers humans up.

00:03:43.050 --> 00:03:45.800
Memories give humans
power to keep going at a cellular level.

00:03:46.720 --> 00:03:50.770
This is an understanding that I,
F.F., lacked before meeting Jolyne.

00:03:52.520 --> 00:03:53.350
That's right.

00:03:54.270 --> 00:03:55.190
That is…

00:03:55.770 --> 00:03:59.230
That is what it means
to be an intelligent being.

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:05.320
Which do you prioritize?

00:04:05.410 --> 00:04:06.950
Is it me?

00:04:07.030 --> 00:04:10.450
Or is it finishing D an' G?

00:04:15.580 --> 00:04:17.090
You hesitated for a split second!

00:04:17.170 --> 00:04:19.670
That will cost you your life!

00:04:27.720 --> 00:04:31.980
I gave you intellect and a Stand.

00:04:33.520 --> 00:04:35.190
I am taking it back.

00:04:36.480 --> 00:04:40.730
When I think about Jolyne,
I feel courage swelling up inside me.

00:04:41.570 --> 00:04:43.700
This is what memories do.

00:04:44.650 --> 00:04:47.700
This is… my intellect!

00:04:50.240 --> 00:04:51.660
What?

00:04:58.540 --> 00:04:59.630
No…

00:05:00.750 --> 00:05:03.010
Is F.F. planning to--

00:05:06.340 --> 00:05:08.430
Their bodily fluids entered his body!

00:05:14.390 --> 00:05:16.350
Impossible…

00:05:21.980 --> 00:05:24.030
Am I…

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:32.450
Looks like F.F. did it.

00:05:32.950 --> 00:05:35.040
They must have killed its User.

00:05:38.170 --> 00:05:39.330
Where is the fruit?

00:05:56.270 --> 00:05:57.600
What the hell?

00:05:58.690 --> 00:06:00.560
Does this mean that it's born?

00:06:01.270 --> 00:06:04.820
Is this what Pale Snake wanted?

00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:10.910
What the hell is this thing?

00:06:11.700 --> 00:06:13.700
Why was it given life?

00:06:14.240 --> 00:06:16.250
Why does it exist here?

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:20.960
Were the prisoners mutated
just to give life to this thing?

00:06:21.710 --> 00:06:26.130
Now that it's born,
my body is no longer mutating.

00:06:26.210 --> 00:06:27.670
It stopped turning into a plant.

00:06:36.970 --> 00:06:39.440
You must not let F.F. escape!

00:06:39.520 --> 00:06:41.730
Read the memory inside the disc!

00:06:42.310 --> 00:06:47.320
Tell me the whereabouts
of the spawn of Dio's bone!

00:06:47.400 --> 00:06:50.780
Will I even last 30 seconds
when I'm exposed like this?

00:06:50.860 --> 00:06:51.860
I need water.

00:06:52.370 --> 00:06:56.620
I need to tell Jolyne
who Pale Snake really is!

00:06:59.040 --> 00:06:59.870
Shit.

00:07:00.460 --> 00:07:03.500
I have to tell her that
he's the prison's chaplain, Father Pucchi!

00:07:06.630 --> 00:07:10.220
Are you trying to reach the
faucet at the entrance?

00:07:10.300 --> 00:07:14.430
Before you go,
I have one question for you!

00:07:18.100 --> 00:07:20.100
You can't escape my Stand!

00:07:37.870 --> 00:07:43.370
There's one thing I want to ask, F.F.

00:07:44.080 --> 00:07:46.040
It's a very simple question.

00:07:46.130 --> 00:07:47.590
Did you see it?

00:07:48.250 --> 00:07:50.760
Did you see the thing born
at the Disciplinary Wing?

00:07:51.470 --> 00:07:53.050
How did it look?

00:07:53.550 --> 00:07:55.180
Was it a plant?

00:07:55.260 --> 00:07:56.720
Was it beautiful?

00:07:56.800 --> 00:08:01.640
What is a priest doing
at a prison like this?

00:08:01.730 --> 00:08:05.230
I hope you understand that
I'm asking the questions here.

00:08:05.310 --> 00:08:10.820
I can easily extract your memory
and read it to understand what was born.

00:08:11.690 --> 00:08:14.860
But I wanted to know how you felt.

00:08:15.360 --> 00:08:19.990
Things like it looked soft
or that it was beautiful

00:08:20.080 --> 00:08:24.080
are your opinions, and can't be read
from a memory disc.

00:08:24.830 --> 00:08:28.210
Are you worried that the spawn
will escape?

00:08:28.290 --> 00:08:29.550
You're afraid of losing it.

00:08:30.380 --> 00:08:32.510
Is it able to move already?

00:08:32.590 --> 00:08:33.970
How the hell should I know?

00:08:34.050 --> 00:08:38.010
I'd be more worried about it
getting destroyed.

00:08:38.100 --> 00:08:41.720
No, maybe it's already done.

00:08:41.810 --> 00:08:44.730
Jolyne is with that mean asshole,
after all.

00:08:45.270 --> 00:08:47.810
If she's compelled to,
she'll finish it off.

00:08:47.900 --> 00:08:50.400
It's impossible to defeat it.

00:08:50.480 --> 00:08:52.150
That will never happen.

00:08:53.110 --> 00:08:57.780
No one can destroy it,
that much I know well.

00:08:57.870 --> 00:09:02.500
My only concern is Jolyne
causing trouble and losing it.

00:09:02.580 --> 00:09:06.540
Jotaro's memory alone is enough
to control the birthed creature,

00:09:07.120 --> 00:09:10.130
and I have his memory.

00:09:10.210 --> 00:09:13.050
We are so close to the end.

00:09:13.130 --> 00:09:14.920
What is it shaped like?

00:09:15.010 --> 00:09:18.220
Did it grow faster than you expected?

00:09:19.720 --> 00:09:22.180
I thought it was gonna drown in water.

00:09:22.770 --> 00:09:25.600
And then, what else was there?

00:09:25.690 --> 00:09:27.900
Let's see…

00:09:28.730 --> 00:09:30.860
It's stalling for time! Turn around!

00:09:33.940 --> 00:09:35.280
I did it!

00:09:35.360 --> 00:09:39.620
My soul isn't in my head,

00:09:39.700 --> 00:09:41.490
it's over there.

00:09:41.580 --> 00:09:43.540
I have water now!

00:09:44.040 --> 00:09:46.290
I can go tell Jolyne everything!

00:09:55.880 --> 00:09:57.300
Your soul, you say?

00:09:57.380 --> 00:10:02.390
No matter where your intelligence lies,
you're not the one making decisions here.

00:10:03.220 --> 00:10:06.680
I am the one who endowed you
with a Stand ability.

00:10:08.810 --> 00:10:10.440
You filthy plankton!

00:10:10.520 --> 00:10:14.230
Don't you dare give me explanations,
as if you know better than I do!

00:10:22.240 --> 00:10:25.830
My body! This water…

00:10:25.910 --> 00:10:30.040
What is streaming out of it?

00:10:30.790 --> 00:10:31.670
No, it can't be!

00:10:32.250 --> 00:10:33.670
It's steaming hot water.

00:10:33.750 --> 00:10:40.300
No aquatic organism on earth can dwell
in water hotter than 32 degrees Celsius.

00:10:40.380 --> 00:10:43.680
A different Stand ability that
turns water into hot water…

00:10:43.760 --> 00:10:45.850
…was inserted into this thing.

00:10:45.930 --> 00:10:49.940
Only I get to decide
where your intellect lies.

00:10:50.020 --> 00:10:52.520
You are using your own ability to turn

00:10:52.610 --> 00:10:54.770
the water you touch
into boiling hot water!

00:11:08.120 --> 00:11:10.080
Jolyne!

00:11:34.060 --> 00:11:35.940
STAND NAME: GREEN, GREEN, GREEN HOME
STAND MASTER: THE GREEN BABY

00:11:37.360 --> 00:11:39.190
Where is it? Where did it fall?

00:11:39.940 --> 00:11:41.950
Shit, don't tell me it drowned.

00:11:44.570 --> 00:11:46.530
No…

00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:51.370
Does it have a mind of its own?

00:11:51.460 --> 00:11:53.670
Since it's trying to escape?

00:11:54.290 --> 00:11:55.250
No…

00:11:55.330 --> 00:11:58.000
Instinct is its only drive.

00:11:58.090 --> 00:12:02.220
I don't know whether it's a plant or not,
but I don't want it to go anywhere.

00:12:02.800 --> 00:12:05.590
I can't let Pale Snake have it.

00:12:07.890 --> 00:12:08.810
Jolyne!

00:12:12.270 --> 00:12:13.890
Wait, Jolyne!

00:12:13.980 --> 00:12:16.980
Don't move, look at the rock by your foot!

00:12:20.480 --> 00:12:21.490
Listen closely.

00:12:21.570 --> 00:12:22.900
Don't take another step.

00:12:23.570 --> 00:12:25.200
Turn around and look at me.

00:12:30.540 --> 00:12:32.960
When the pebble rolled over here,
it turned into a rock.

00:12:33.040 --> 00:12:36.170
Meanwhile, Jolyne, you grew smaller.

00:12:37.500 --> 00:12:40.380
Stop! I said don't go near it!

00:12:45.840 --> 00:12:48.430
What just happened, Anastasia?

00:12:48.970 --> 00:12:51.140
Why did you grow shorter?

00:12:57.100 --> 00:13:00.070
-What's going on, Anastasia?
-Stay calm, Jolyne.

00:13:01.730 --> 00:13:05.360
By the way, how big
does that baby look to you?

00:13:06.410 --> 00:13:09.530
It hasn't changed.
Its size is the same as before.

00:13:09.620 --> 00:13:10.910
Anastasia,

00:13:10.990 --> 00:13:13.950
it looks like you are the one
who grew shorter to me.

00:13:14.040 --> 00:13:15.120
What's going on?

00:13:15.750 --> 00:13:19.210
The baby's size looks
about average to me too.

00:13:20.000 --> 00:13:21.960
Only the pebble
we kicked over got smaller.

00:13:22.760 --> 00:13:25.050
Jolyne, don't move.

00:13:25.630 --> 00:13:27.010
Stay right where you are.

00:13:33.310 --> 00:13:34.390
You're back to normal.

00:13:34.980 --> 00:13:37.690
Do you think that
this is the baby's ability?

00:13:37.770 --> 00:13:42.980
The closer we get to the baby,
the shorter we grow.

00:13:43.070 --> 00:13:44.690
I don't have a clue.

00:13:44.780 --> 00:13:46.950
That's a heavy line of questioning.

00:13:47.950 --> 00:13:51.870
Now listen, if we get halfway to the baby,

00:13:51.950 --> 00:13:54.080
my height shrinks by half.

00:13:54.580 --> 00:13:56.540
That means we have to walk twice as much.

00:13:56.620 --> 00:13:57.670
Okay.

00:13:57.750 --> 00:14:00.920
Furthermore, if we get
a fourth of the way to the baby,

00:14:01.000 --> 00:14:02.750
then the distance grows by four times.

00:14:03.380 --> 00:14:05.590
At one-eighth,
we walk eight times as much.

00:14:07.220 --> 00:14:08.840
1/32nd,

00:14:08.930 --> 00:14:10.390
1/64th,

00:14:10.890 --> 00:14:12.600
1/128th…

00:14:13.140 --> 00:14:14.600
Our body will keep shrinking,

00:14:14.680 --> 00:14:16.980
while the distance
multiplies more and more.

00:14:17.060 --> 00:14:18.560
Here is the question.

00:14:19.650 --> 00:14:22.570
Will we ever reach that baby?

00:14:24.190 --> 00:14:26.650
I say no, not in an eternity.

00:14:30.700 --> 00:14:34.700
But in order to get
my father's memory back,

00:14:35.580 --> 00:14:37.910
I have to get the baby.

00:14:38.000 --> 00:14:40.500
-Jolyne.
-Anastasia, we'll think

00:14:40.580 --> 00:14:43.090
after we've done everything we can!

00:14:44.590 --> 00:14:47.050
It's her focus.

00:14:47.130 --> 00:14:50.510
The way Jolyne can fixate
towards one goal.

00:14:50.590 --> 00:14:55.310
I'm here because I'm drawn to
the way she focuses on one thing.

00:14:55.390 --> 00:14:57.980
The ability to concentrate
enhances a person's beauty.

00:14:58.060 --> 00:15:00.850
Those eyes…

00:15:00.940 --> 00:15:05.860
In time, I'll have you gaze at me
with that intense focus of yours.

00:15:22.960 --> 00:15:24.960
Stone Ocean!

00:15:26.380 --> 00:15:28.630
I'm about to reach it! I can catch it!

00:15:30.550 --> 00:15:33.470
It's no use, Jolyne.
Pull your thread back!

00:15:33.550 --> 00:15:35.970
There is no way to reach the baby!

00:15:36.060 --> 00:15:37.430
I can't give up!

00:15:37.510 --> 00:15:38.930
There has to be an end.

00:15:39.020 --> 00:15:40.890
I mean, it's right there!

00:15:44.730 --> 00:15:47.940
What do you say to jumping off from here?

00:15:49.030 --> 00:15:51.450
If I do, I'll reach an end point.

00:15:51.530 --> 00:15:53.160
The ground is the finishing point.

00:15:53.240 --> 00:15:54.910
I have to land at some point!

00:15:55.990 --> 00:15:57.450
Stop, Jolyne! Don't--

00:15:57.530 --> 00:16:00.160
Yes! The ground is right there!

00:16:00.250 --> 00:16:01.960
I can almost reach it!

00:16:02.460 --> 00:16:03.290
What's happening?

00:16:04.670 --> 00:16:05.630
My string…

00:16:11.630 --> 00:16:13.340
What the hell is that?

00:16:18.430 --> 00:16:20.220
Don't tell me…

00:16:20.310 --> 00:16:22.350
Is this the baby's Stand?

00:16:22.430 --> 00:16:24.770
Damn, haven't I reached the ground yet?

00:16:28.820 --> 00:16:32.240
It hasn't only grown in size,
but in power as well!

00:16:32.320 --> 00:16:33.740
Its power has multiplied!

00:16:33.820 --> 00:16:37.030
This Stand… It appeared
just to drag me down,

00:16:37.990 --> 00:16:42.370
so I won't ever escape
this never-ending fall!

00:16:42.450 --> 00:16:44.000
Stone Ocean!

00:16:47.380 --> 00:16:49.800
If this is the baby's ability,

00:16:49.880 --> 00:16:53.340
then catching the Stand
is the same as catching the User!

00:17:04.480 --> 00:17:06.850
I'm shrinking!

00:17:06.940 --> 00:17:08.860
It's trying to reduce me to nothing!

00:17:09.480 --> 00:17:11.360
The end I thought I'd reach
wasn't the ground.

00:17:11.440 --> 00:17:12.610
It was this Stand!

00:17:19.320 --> 00:17:20.620
Diver Drive.

00:17:34.210 --> 00:17:38.390
The closer you get to the baby,
the smaller you get.

00:17:38.470 --> 00:17:40.470
Eventually, you will be
reduced to nothing.

00:17:41.140 --> 00:17:46.140
I don't know why a baby
with such a powerful Stand was born,

00:17:47.020 --> 00:17:48.900
but I know he will be an enemy someday.

00:17:48.980 --> 00:17:53.030
Jolyne, this baby is your enemy.

00:17:53.110 --> 00:17:54.360
But…

00:17:54.440 --> 00:17:56.110
if there's no way to defeat it,

00:17:56.200 --> 00:17:59.530
then I really can't let
Pale Snake have it.

00:18:12.460 --> 00:18:14.840
Anastasia, hold on tight!

00:18:19.180 --> 00:18:21.260
It threw the rock!

00:18:21.350 --> 00:18:22.720
Does that mean…

00:18:22.810 --> 00:18:24.390
that it's thinking for itself?

00:18:24.470 --> 00:18:28.230
The baby is now
deliberately using its ability!

00:18:29.390 --> 00:18:31.060
It's coming. Climb!

00:18:31.610 --> 00:18:33.900
We need to escape as fast as possible!

00:18:33.980 --> 00:18:34.900
Run!

00:18:52.040 --> 00:18:56.590
No matter how much we chase it,
we will never reach that baby.

00:18:57.210 --> 00:18:59.590
But at least, we caught the Stand.

00:19:00.180 --> 00:19:02.220
Jolyne, do you still not see

00:19:02.300 --> 00:19:05.640
what we were climbing toward?

00:19:07.350 --> 00:19:08.560
It was a gamble.

00:19:09.480 --> 00:19:12.310
The baby is intelligent and curious.

00:19:12.900 --> 00:19:15.480
Earlier, it touched the bottle I threw.

00:19:15.570 --> 00:19:18.820
When the baby chooses to touch an object,
its size stays the same.

00:19:18.900 --> 00:19:22.110
In other words,
the bottle's size hasn't changed.

00:19:24.370 --> 00:19:28.040
If we can't catch the baby,
we'll have the baby chase after us.

00:19:28.120 --> 00:19:29.960
We finally reached the bottle.

00:19:30.540 --> 00:19:32.710
The Stand is inside the bottle now.

00:19:32.790 --> 00:19:36.040
All we have to do now
is trap it inside the bottle!

00:19:37.500 --> 00:19:43.550
But… how are we getting out of here?

00:19:46.140 --> 00:19:51.100
I'm having Diver Drive enter
the bottle's wall.

00:19:51.730 --> 00:19:54.190
It's bringing the mouth to us.
Let's go, Jolyne.

00:19:54.940 --> 00:19:56.400
Run for it!

00:20:04.570 --> 00:20:05.910
We finally caught it.

00:20:07.120 --> 00:20:09.240
We got its User, the baby too.

00:20:15.830 --> 00:20:17.340
It's changing its position.

00:20:17.420 --> 00:20:19.420
It's using the bottle to charge forward!

00:20:26.930 --> 00:20:27.890
Anastasia!

00:20:27.970 --> 00:20:29.850
Stone Ocean!

00:20:30.930 --> 00:20:32.020
Jolyne!

00:20:32.100 --> 00:20:33.520
You can't break the bottle.

00:20:33.600 --> 00:20:36.020
We'll be worse off
if we have to face the Stand!

00:20:36.770 --> 00:20:40.730
Did the baby have this in mind
when it rolled the bottle?

00:20:40.820 --> 00:20:42.690
Shit, we're in deep trouble now!

00:20:43.450 --> 00:20:45.700
-Don't break the bottle!
-But…

00:20:45.780 --> 00:20:48.030
At this rate, you're done for!

00:21:14.850 --> 00:21:17.520
Anastasia, look…

00:21:18.610 --> 00:21:20.980
What the hell?

00:21:21.070 --> 00:21:23.070
What's going on?

00:21:23.150 --> 00:21:25.360
Jolyne, looks like…

00:21:26.110 --> 00:21:30.030
it's interested in the star-shaped
birthmark on your left shoulder.

00:21:30.620 --> 00:21:35.250
Since it touched you,
we turned back to our original size.

00:21:37.540 --> 00:21:41.040
The baby has the same birthmark
on its shoulder.

00:21:41.750 --> 00:21:43.260
What's going on?

00:21:44.210 --> 00:21:47.130
The baby acts like it has known
Jolyne for a long time.

00:21:47.720 --> 00:21:52.470
Hey, it looks as if it likes me.

00:21:52.560 --> 00:21:54.020
What should I do?

00:21:54.100 --> 00:21:56.850
It likes her? No, that's not it.

00:21:57.440 --> 00:21:59.150
I have no doubt about it.

00:21:59.230 --> 00:22:01.190
He will turn against us.

00:22:01.270 --> 00:22:05.400
I can only sense endless darkness
from this baby's ability.

00:22:06.070 --> 00:22:09.910
Yes, we may need this baby

00:22:09.990 --> 00:22:12.200
to retrieve your father's disc
from Pale Snake,

00:22:12.280 --> 00:22:15.040
but I must kill it while I can.

